      "content": "SP 90 NW      CHOLESBURY-CUM-ST. LEONARDS      HAWRIDGE                                                (south side) 2/68                                  \t       Benton Potts - -                                              II Cottage. C17 timber framed with whitewashed brick and flint to ground floor and infill.  Old tiled roof. Offset chimneys to each gable and one on ridge in centre.   Four ground floor modern leaded casements, three gabled eaves dormers. Listing NGR: SP9367706908"
